  "description": "Headless scientific visualization: safely executes OmnibusCloud ParaView packages (a saved .pvsm state plus content-addressed data attachments) and distributes independent rendering tasks across worker nodes. ParaView.Validate treats the state as untrusted input (hardened XML parsing, proxy allowlist, programmable-pipeline rejection, logical-path and plugin-requirement checks, size and resolution limits); ParaView.Split produces deterministic tasks per timestep, each carrying only the attachments its timestep needs (per-task attachment subsetting); ParaView.RenderFrame materializes a task's subset into an isolated package root and renders one output through the controller-owned pvpython runner on the software-rendering baseline; ParaView.Collect returns the ordered frame set. The ParaView runtime ships as per-platform Tier-2 assets, never inside the package.",
